    "gen_ai.input.messages": "[{\"role\":\"user\",\"parts\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":\"<session_context>\\nThis is the Gemini CLI. We are setting up the context for our chat.\\nToday's date is Thursday, October 15, 2026 (formatted according to the user's locale).\\nMy operating system is: darwin\\nThe project's temporary directory is: /Users/mohammadpoorahmadi/.gemini/tmp/run\\n- **Workspace Directories:**\\n  - /Users/mohammadpoorahmadi/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/assignments/03-anatomy-of-coding-agents/gemini-cli-dissection/work/run\\n- **Directory Structure:**\\n\\nShowing up to 200 items (files + folders). Folders or files indicated with ... contain more items not shown, were ignored, or the display limit (200 items) was reached.\\n\\n/Users/mohammadpoorahmadi/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/assignments/03-anatomy-of-coding-agents/gemini-cli-dissection/work/run/\\n├───.DS_Store\\n├───.gitignore\\n├───GEMINI.md\\n├───README.md\\n├───requirements.txt\\n├───TASK.md\\n├───.gemini/\\n│   └───settings.json\\n├───.pytest_cache/...\\n├───shopcart/\\n│   ├───__init__.py\\n│   ├───cart.py\\n│   ├───catalog.py\\n│   ├───pricing.py\\n│   └───__pycache__/...\\n└───tests/\\n    ├───__init__.py\\n    ├───test_cart.py\\n    ├───test_pricing.py\\n    └───__pycache__/...\\n\\n\\n<loaded_context>\\n<project_context>\\n--- Context from: /Users/mohammadpoorahmadi/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/assignments/03-anatomy-of-coding-agents/gemini-cli-dissection/work/run/GEMINI.md ---\\n# Project context\\n\\n- Python 3.10+ library; no third-party runtime dependencies.\\n- All money is integer **cents**. Never use floats for stored amounts.\\n- Run tests with `python -m pytest -q` from the repository root.\\n- Keep functions small; pricing rules live in `shopcart/pricing.py`, cart state in `shopcart/cart.py`.\\n--- End of Context from: /Users/mohammadpoorahmadi/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/assignments/03-anatomy-of-coding-agents/gemini-cli-dissection/work/run/GEMINI.md ---\\n</project_context>\\n</loaded_context>\\n</session_context>\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":\"Read TASK.md and complete all of it. First write out your plan, then carry it out without waiting for my confirmation.\"}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"parts\":[{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"name\":\"update_topic\",\"id\":\"call_365612\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Reading TASK.md and Planning\\\",\\\"strategic_intent\\\":\\\"Reading TASK.md to understand the assignment requirements and formulating a comprehensive plan to complete all tasks.\\\"}\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"name\":\"read_file\",\"id\":\"call_365613\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"file_path\\\":\\\"TASK.md\\\"}\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"parts\":[{\"type\":\"tool_call_response\",\"response\":\"{\\\"output\\\":\\\"Current topic: \\\\\\\"Reading TASK.md and Planning\\\\\\\"\\\\nTopic summary: ...\\\\n\\\\nStrategic Intent: Reading TASK.md to understand the assignment requirements and formulating a comprehensive plan to complete all tasks.\\\"}\",\"id\":\"call_365612\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call_response\",\"response\":\"{\\\"output\\\":\\\"# Task\\\\n\\\\n## 1. Fix the failing tests\\\\n`python -m pytest` currently fails. Make the whole suite pass by fixing the code in\\\\n`shopcart/`. The existing tests describe the intended behavior — do not edit them for\\\\nthis step.\\\\n\\\\n## 2. Add shipping to cart totals\\\\n- Orders pay a flat **$5.99** shipping fee (`599` cents).\\\\n- Shipping is **free** when the subtotal *after discount, before tax* is **$50.00 or more**.\\\\n- An empty cart pays no shipping.\\\\n- Shipping is **not taxed**: `total = tax(discounted subtotal) + shipping`.\\\\n- Put the shipping rule in `shopcart/pricing.py` and use it from `Cart.total()`.\\\\n\\\\nSome existing tests check `Cart.total()` with values from before shipping existed. You may\\\\nupdate those expected values — and only those — and note why in a comment.\\\\n\\\\n## 3. Test it\\\\nAdd tests covering the shipping rules (including the free-shipping threshold), then run\\\\nthe full suite and confirm it passes.\\\\n\\\"}\",\"id\":\"call_365613\"}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"parts\":[{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"name\":\"run_shell_command\",\"id\":\"call_318944\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m pytest\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Run pytest to check current test failures\\\"}\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"parts\":[{\"type\":\"tool_call_response\",\"response\":\"{\\\"output\\\":\\\"<untrusted_context>\\\\nOutput: ====================================================================================== test session starts =======================================================================================\\\\nplatform darwin -- Python 3.13.13, pytest-9.1.1, pluggy-1.7.0\\\\nrootdir: /Users/mohammadpoorahmadi/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/assignments/03-anatomy-of-coding-agents/gemini-cli-dissection/work/run\\\\ncollected 14 items                                                                                                                                                                               \\\\n\\\\ntests/test_cart.py ..F.....F                                                                                                                                                               [ 64%]\\\\ntests/test_pricing.py .....                                                                                                                                                                [100%]\\\\n\\\\n============================================================================================ FAILURES ============================================================================================\\\\n__________________________________________________________________________ test_add_same_item_twice_increments_quantity 