se expected values — and only those — and note why in a comment.\\\\n\\\\n## 3. Test it\\\\nAdd tests covering the shipping rules (including the free-shipping threshold), then run\\\\nthe full suite and confirm it passes.\\\\n\\\"}\",\"id\":\"call_365613\"}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"parts\":[{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"name\":\"run_shell_command\",\"id\":\"call_318944\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m pytest\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Run pytest to check current test failures\\\"}\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"parts\":[{\"type\":\"tool_call_response\",\"response\":\"{\\\"output\\\":\\\"<untrusted_context>\\\\nOutput: ====================================================================================== test session starts =======================================================================================\\\\nplatform darwin -- Python 3.13.13, pytest-9.1.1, pluggy-1.7.0\\\\nrootdir: /Users/mohammadpoorahmadi/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/AI-Augmented-Software-Engineering/assignments/03-anatomy-of-coding-agents/gemini-cli-dissection/work/run\\\\ncollected 14 items                                                                                                                                                                               \\\\n\\\\ntests/test_cart.py ..F.....F                                                                                                                                                               [ 64%]\\\\ntests/test_pricing.py .....                                                                                                                                                                [100%]\\\\n\\\\n============================================================================================ FAILURES ============================================================================================\\\\n__________________________________________________________________________ test_add_same_item_twice_increments_quantity 