    "role": "main",
    "response_text": "[{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"**Confirming Test Success**\\n\\nI'm pleased to report that the `test_add_same_item_twice_increments_quantity` and all tests in `tests/test_pricing.py` have passed. The focus now is on addressing the anticipated failures related to `Cart.total()` which, as expected, are the only remaining failing tests after the successes above.\\n\\n\\n\",\"thought\":true}],\"role\":\"model\"},\"index\":0}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"promptTokenCount\":17359,\"totalTokenCount\":17705,\"promptTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":17359}],\"thoughtsTokenCount\":346,\"serviceTier\":\"standard\"},\"responseId\":\"N7DQarnIJ7qWvdIPgKq-MA\",\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-3.5-flash-lite\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"**Updating Test Expected Values**\\n\\nI've updated the expected values in `test_cart.py` for three existing tests to reflect the new $5.99 shipping fee. I've also added comments explaining the rationale for the changes. Now, I'm moving on to adding tests that cover the shipping rules, including the free-shipping threshold. Once those are added, I'll run the full test suite again to confirm all passes.\\n\\n\\n\",\"thought\":true}],\"role\":\"model\"},\"index\":0}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"promptTokenCount\":17359,\"totalTokenCount\":17981,\"promptTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":17359}],\"thoughtsTokenCount\":622,\"serviceTier\":\"standard\"},\"responseId\":\"N7DQarnIJ7qWvdIPgKq-MA\",\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-3.5-flash-lite\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"**Defining Shipping Rules**\\n\\nI am now focused on defining and testing the shipping rules. I'm writing tests for scenarios with and without the free-shipping threshold. I'm covering a situation where the subtotal *before* discount is above the threshold, but the *discounted* subtotal is below it, which means shipping applies. I'm also adding tests for the inverse. I'm deciding which test file is the right one for these. I'm also checking what items are available to better construct the test cases.\\n\\n\\n\",\"thought\":true}],\"role\":\"model\"},\"index\":0}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"promptTokenCount\":17359,\"totalTokenCount\":18524,\"promptTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":17359}],\"thoughtsTokenCount\":1165,\"serviceTier\":\"standard\"},\"responseId\":\"N7DQarnIJ7qWvdIPgKq-MA\",\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-3.5-flash-lite\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"**Adding Shipping Test Cases**\\n\\nI'm currently focused on incorporating these new test cases into `tests/test_cart.py`. I've outlined scenarios to confirm the shipping fee application under and above the threshold, including the impact of discounts on free shipping eligibility. Specifically, I'm verifying the cart total with shipping applied when the discounted amount falls below the free shipping threshold, and the reverse.\\n\\n\\n\",\"thought\":true}],\"role\":\"model\"},\"index\":0}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"promptTokenCount\":17359,\"totalTokenCount\":19032,\"promptTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":17359}],\"thoughtsTokenCount\":1673,\"serviceTier\":\"standard\"},\"responseId\":\"N7DQarnIJ7qWvdIPgKq-MA\",\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-3.5-flash-lite\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"parts\":[{\"functionCall\":{\"name\":\"replace\",\"args\":{\"old_string\":\"def test_total_includes_tax():\\n    cart = Cart()\\n    cart.add_item(\\\"TEE\\\")\\n    assert cart.total() == 2160  # 2000 + 8% tax\\n\\n\\ndef test_percent_discount():\\n    cart = Cart()\\n    cart.add_item(\\\"MUG\\\", 2)\\n    cart.apply_code(\\\"SAVE10\\\")\\n    assert cart.total() == 2333  # (2400 - 10%) + 8% tax\\n\\n\\ndef test_fixed_discount_applied_before_tax():\\n    cart = Cart()\\n    cart.add_item(\\\"TEE\\\")\\n    cart.add_item(\\\"TEE\\\")\\n    cart.apply_code(\\\"TENOFF\\\")\\n    assert cart.total() == 3240  # (4000 - 1000) + 8% tax\",\"instruction\":\"Update existing test expectations for cart totals to include flat shipping fee and add new test cases covering shipping rules and thresholds.\",\"file_path\":\"tests/test_cart.py\",\"new_string\":\"def test_total_includes_tax():\\n    cart = Cart()\\n    cart.add_item(\\\"TEE\\\")\\n    # Updated to include flat $5.99 shipping fee since shipping was introduced\\n    assert cart.total() == 2759  # 2000 + 8% tax + 599 shipping\\n\\n\\ndef test_percent_discount():\\n    cart = Cart()\\n    cart.add_item(\\\"MUG\\\", 2)\\n    cart.apply_code(\\\"SAVE10\\\")\\n    # Updated to include flat $5.99 shipping fee since shipping was introduced\\n    assert cart.total() == 2932  # (2400 - 10%) + 8% tax + 599 shipping\\n\\n\\ndef test_fixed_discount_applied_before_tax():\\n    cart = Cart()\\n    cart.add_item(\\\"TEE\\\")\\n    cart.add_item(\\\"TEE\\\")\\n    cart.apply_code(\\\"TENOFF\\\")\\n    # Updated to include flat $5.99 shipping fee since shipping was introduced\\n    assert cart.total() == 3839  # (4000 - 1000) + 8% tax + 599 shipping\\n\\n\\ndef test_shipping_fee_below_threshold():\\n    cart = Cart()\\n    cart.add_item(\\\"TEE\\\")  # 2000 cents (< 5000)\\n    assert cart.total() == 2759  # 2000 + 8% tax + 599 shipping\\n\\n\\ndef test_free_shipping_at_or_above_threshold():\\n    cart = Cart()\\n    cart.add_item(\\\"TEE\\\", 3)  # 6000 cents (>= 5000)\\n    assert cart.total() == 6480  # 6000 + 8% tax + 0 shipping\\n\\n\\ndef test_free_shipping_after_discount():\\n    cart = Cart()\\n    cart.add_item(\\\"TEE\\\", 3)  # 6000 cents\\n    cart.apply_code(\\\"SAVE10\\\")  # 10% off -> 5400 cents (>= 5000)\\n    assert cart.total() == 5832  # 5400 + 8% tax + 0 shipping\\n\\n\\ndef test_shipping_applied_if_discount_drops_below_threshold():\\n    cart = Cart()\\n    cart.add_item(\\\"TEE\\\", 3)  # 6000 cents\\n    cart.apply_code(\\\"SAVE25\\\")  # 25% off -> 4500 cents (< 5000)\\n    assert cart.total() == 5459  # 4500 + 8% tax + 599 shipping\"},\"id\":\"replace__call_471672\"},\"thoughtSignature\":\"\"}],\"role\":\"model\"},\"index\":0}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"promptTokenCount\":17359,\"candidatesTokenCount\":907,\"totalTokenCount\":19939,\"promptTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":17359}],\"thoughtsTokenCount\":1673,\"serviceTier\":\"standard\"},\"responseId\":\"N7DQarnIJ7qWvdIPgKq-MA\",\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-3.5-flash-lite\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"\"}],\"role\":\"model\"},\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"promptTokenCount\":23683,\"candidatesTokenCount\":907,\"totalTokenCount\":26263,\"cachedContentTokenCount\":20289,\"promptTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":23683}],\"cacheTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":20289}],\"thoughtsTokenCount\":1673,\"serviceTier\":\"standard\"},\"responseId\":\"N7DQarnIJ7qWvdIPgKq-MA\",\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-3.5-flash-lite\"}]",
