ence statement of your immediate intent.\"}},\"required\":[\"strategic_intent\"]}},\"invocation\":{\"params\":\"[Circular]\"},\"status\":\"success\",\"response\":{\"callId\":\"update_topic__call_377173\",\"responseParts\":[{\"functionResponse\":{\"id\":\"update_topic__call_377173\",\"name\":\"update_topic\",\"response\":{\"output\":\"Current topic: \\\"Completed TASK.md\\\"\\nTopic summary: I have successfully completed all tasks in TASK.md: 1) Fixed the failing tests by correcting item quantity incrementing and discount order application before tax, 2) Added the shipping rules ($5.99 flat shipping, free shipping when subtotal after discount before tax is $50.00 or more, empty cart pays no shipping, shipping not taxed) in shopcart/pricing.py and integrated it into Cart.total(), 3) Updated existing test expectations for cart totals to include shipping with explanatory comments, and 4) Added comprehensive unit tests covering shipping rules and free-shipping thresholds. All 18 tests passed successfully.\\n\\nStrategic Intent: Completed all tasks outlined in TASK.md, including fixing failing tests, implementing shipping rules, updating existing tests, and adding new test coverage.\"}}}],\"display\":{\"format\":\"notice\",\"name\":\"Completed TASK.md\",\"description\":\"Update topic to: \\\"Completed TASK.md\\\"\"},\"resultDisplay\":\"## 📂 Topic: **Completed TASK.md**\\n\\n**Summary:**\\nI have successfully completed all tasks in TASK.md: 1) Fixed the failing tests by correcting item quantity incrementing and discount order application before tax, 2) Added the shipping rules ($5.99 flat shipping, free shipping when subtotal after discount before tax is $50.00 or more, empty cart pays no shipping, shipping not taxed) in shopcart/pricing.py and integrated it into Cart.total(), 3) Updated existing test expectations for cart totals to include shipping with explanatory comments, and 4) Added comprehensive unit tests covering shipping rules and free-shipping thresholds. All 18 tests passed successfully.\\n\\n> [!STRATEGY]\\n> **Intent:** Completed all tasks outlined in TASK.md, including fixing failing tests, implementing shipping rules, updating existing tests, and adding new test coverage.\",\"contentLength\":847},\"durationMs\":1,\"outcome\":\"proceed_once\",\"schedulerId\":\"root\",\"approvalMode\":\"autoEdit\"}]",
