"content\":\"cart.py` covering shipping fees below threshold, free shipping at/above threshold, free shipping after percent discount, and shipping\"}]},{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\",\"role\":\"system\",\"parts\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":\" applied when discounts drop the subtotal below the threshold.\\n   - Verified the entire test suite passes (`18 passed`).\"}]},{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\",\"role\":\"system\",\"parts\":[{\"type\":\"unknown\",\"text\":\"\",\"thoughtSignature\":\"EtgBCtUBAWkUfRMAxBK1YgQKdBOD938A5z9QhIEvZgPy84Fj7LPLG+ruMr/Hsw2WI+YErk1VfNMK8RaKGi0OjTpDJwXt7P4y9QXZlVvDlvcXMp49K0IaoneF18GP32CWmkpHycVd7oM9LLOBBDbIMcjbODhSiihdW7ECRs3p0PJ03uM8PL+lFz8VGgtFXR01PV/MsLb68+iBy1+ut0DDL1nlACU/ZWmiYhdWA4mjmTfGnOLK9gg9sTc/E49nXNGQyJZAULZVPo6t6qq5w5vAdU/DJi1c/nR/m0AQ\"}]}]",
