al` in `shopcart/pricing.py` to correctly apply discounts *before* calculating tax.\\n\\n2. **Added Shipping to Cart Totals:**\\n   - Implemented shipping rules in `shopcart/pricing.py`: flat **$5.99** (`599` cents) shipping fee, free shipping when the discounted subtotal (before tax) is **$50.00 or more** (`5000` cents), zero shipping for empty carts, and untaxed shipping (`total = tax(discounted subtotal) + shipping`).\\n   - Integrated shipping calculation into `Cart.total()`.\\n   - Updated existing test assertions for cart totals with comments explaining the inclusion of shipping.\\n\\n3. **Added Comprehensive Testing:**\\n   - Added new test cases in `tests/test_cart.py` covering shipping fees below threshold, free shipping at/above threshold, free shipping after percent discount, and shipping applied when discounts drop the subtotal below the threshold.\\n   - Verified the entire test suite passes (`18 passed`).\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"python -m pytest -q\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"functionCall\":{\"name\":\"run_shell_command\",\"args\":{\"command\":\"python -m pytest -q\",\"description\":\"Run pytest in quiet mode to verify all tests pass\"},\"id\":\"call_345068\"},\"thoughtSignature\":\"\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"parts\":[{\"functionResponse\":{\"id\":\"call_345068\",\"name\":\"run_shell_command\",\"response\":{\"output\":\"<untrusted_context>\\nOutput: ..................                                                                                                                                                                         [100%]\\n18 passed in 0.01s\\nProcess Group PGID: 7421\\n</untrusted_context>\"}}}]}]",
